[Connect to the hosted MCP](#connect-to-the-hosted-endpoint) · [Watch the 18-second demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chrisdoc/hevy-mcp/main/docs/assets/hevy-mcp-demo.mp4) · [Explore all 22 tools](#tools)

